// A representative live-run status map (issue #219): one of every settled/in-flight status, keyed
// by the SAME node ids MermaidRenderer emits — the plan-level brackets (plan_preflights /
// plan_guardrails), a task container (task_01_a), and its preflight/guardrail leaf nodes
// (task_01_a_pf_0 / task_01_a_gr_0). The five status words are the whole vocabulary the overlay
